// R1: activity in an unapproved region, including denied attempts (the region SCP).
AWSCloudTrail
| where AWSRegion !in ("us-east-1", "us-west-2")
// Denied calls only: the region SCP's denial is the signal. Without this, AWS service
// and read-only calls in us-east-2 made ~28 incidents every 3 hours.
| where isnotempty(ErrorCode)
| summarize Calls = count(), Denied = countif(isnotempty(ErrorCode)), Events = make_set(EventName, 10)
    by UserIdentityArn, AWSRegion
